<title>USA: Acadia SD 7, La., won by First Natl Bk of Commerce.</title>
<headline>Acadia SD 7, La., won by First Natl Bk of Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First National Bank of Commerce, New Orleans, said it won $2.750 million of Acadia Parish Fifth Ward School District No 7, La., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.08 91 percent.</p>
</text>
